      'Marks, type, color, illustration, and packaging: the rules every other asset inherits. A generative pipeline can turn out a thousand assets that are each fine and together off-brand. A tight system is what keeps high volume on-brand, so we usually build it first.',
    services: [
      {
        name: 'Brand Identity',
